# WHITELIST. Everything is ignored unless re-included below, so game data,
# dumps, build output and local config can never be committed by accident.
# Adding a new kind of file? Add a narrow pattern here on purpose.
# (`cargo xtask leak-check` and CI double-check what is tracked.)

*
!*/

# Repository metadata and tooling config
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/.github/workflows/*.yml
!/.githooks/pre-commit
!/.cargo/config.toml
!/.env.example
!/deny.toml
!/rustfmt.toml

# Legal and top-level docs
!/LICENSE-MIT
!/LICENSE-APACHE
!/NOTICE
!/README.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md

# Rust workspace
!/Cargo.toml
!/Cargo.lock
!/crates/*/Cargo.toml
!/crates/*/src/**/*.rs
!/crates/*/src/**/*.wgsl
!/crates/*/tests/*.rs
!/xtask/Cargo.toml
!/xtask/src/**/*.rs

# Documentation (Markdown only)
!/docs/**/*.md

# Python research tools and their tests
!/tools/*.py
!/tests/*.py

# Never, even if a pattern above matches.
/target/
.env
.claude/
__pycache__/
